Reason: Give class id 13 (the Necromancer) its entry in the six per-class dodge/miss/parry tables patch 0024 left at 12 entries: the Warlock's values, its parent, so slot 13 is not 0/0. Patch 0024 raised MAX_CLASSES to 15 but initialised only ids 1..12, so the Necromancer's slot is zero-initialised, and the diminishing formulas divide `0 * cap / (0 + cap * k)`, which is 0/0 = NaN when the defense-rating term is 0 (a Necromancer's miss chance, parry and dodge). The playable mask already carries id 13 (bit 12), so it is untouched. Id 14 (the Witch Doctor) stays empty until its class lands.
Target: AzerothCore at core-commit.txt, after patch 0024 (it edits the lines 0024 added; it applies with or without 0025-0029, which sit in other lines).

